ke  they're also getting more transparent  about  when that that stopwatch  stops meaning what can put your  application on hold so because each geo  has a different process and because  those timelines vary understanding what  those timelines are up front is really  important so that you can ensure the  process goes as smoothly as possible and  that's why knowing early  having companies investing and getting  the right help  to ensure that the process goes as  smoothly as possible given the very  tight timelines is an important first  step  thank you so much dr fine glass for your  wonderful insight here and a fantastic  presentation again today  um unfortunately we're out of time but  don't worry any questions that were  submitted and not answered today by our  speaker will be addressed via email  thank you again dr fine glass and thank  you to the audience for your outstanding  questions this presentation will be  available for on-demand viewing for 12  months please remember to share it with  colleagues who might be interested in  today's topic and don't miss out on the  other presentations on our agenda visit  the agenda tab in the auditorium for a  full listing  thank you again for your participation  and until next time goodbye  thank you

